    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS present a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial detached family home extending to approximately 2,200 sq ft, set on a generous c. 1/3 acre site in the highly sought-after Kilcully/Whites Cross area of Cork.\r\n\r\nPresented in very good condition throughout, this impressive residence offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for modern family living. The property combines spacious reception areas with comfortable bedroom accommodation, creating a home that is both practical and welcoming.\r\n\r\nExternally, the large mature site provides excellent privacy together with ample parking, expansive garden space, and superb potential for outdoor entertaining, gardening, or future enhancement subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Whites Cross and within easy reach of Cork City, the property enjoys the perfect balance of peaceful countryside living and convenient access to schools, sports clubs, and all local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for families seeking a spacious turnkey home in a prime residential location with generous outdoor space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance - 2.81m x 1.4m \r\nSliding door to porch with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nHall - 3.55m x 2.77m \r\nLarge spacious hall with tiled floor. Arch one leading to bedrooms, Arch two leading to kitchen diner, and Arch three leading to reception rooms. Stairs carpeted with understairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Diner - 7.77m x 4.9m \r\nTiled flooring,  Fitted kitchen, fireplace with log stove, Fridge Freezer, Washing Machine, Dish Washer, Electric Cooker and Hob, Stainless Steel Sink and Drainer, Extra storage in Dining Area, Large window and Sliding doors leading to South facing Garden and patio areas also West facing window on gable wall side.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 1 Downstairs - 5.44m x 4.4m \r\nTimber floor, Featured Fireplace with log burning stove, three large windows to front of property, Curtains and pole.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 ensuite downstairs - 4.8m x 3.48m \r\nRear of property, carpeted, slider robe wardrobes, curtains and poles.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 downstairs - 4.27m x 3.24m \r\nRear of property, fitted wardrobe, carpeted, curtain and pole.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 downstairs - 4.19m x 3.25m \r\nFront of property, Slider robe wardrobe, carpet, curtain and pole.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 downstairs - 3.49m x 2.9m \r\nFront of property. Slider robe property, carpet, curtain and pole.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom downstairs - \r\nExtensively tiled, electric shower, Bath.\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS - \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving room 2 Upstairs - 5.34m x 4.38m \r\nFeatured fireplace, large window overlooking south facing garden also window on west gable wall, Carpet, curtains and poles.\r\n\r\nLiving room 3 Upstairs - 5.53m x 4.4m \r\nFeatured fireplace, Large windows to front and side of property, Carpet, Curtains and Poles.\r\n\r\nWC Upstairs, extensively tiled. - \r\n\r\n\r\nAttics - \r\nBoth attics insulated with C6-8 inch wool insulation. Neither are floored but the upper attic has power via a double socket next to attic hatch for heating. \r\n\r\nRear Garden - \r\nSouth facing; Mature plants and trees, patio areas, large lawn, totally private garden. Concrete garden shed.\r\n\r\nFront Garden - \r\nMature shrubs and boarders. Parking for 4 cars. Front gate and gates on both sides of the property.\r\n\r\n"
      },
